  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a20105d88834d764380d6090e8c10179, type: 3}
  m_Name: The Legacy of Mirage Plains
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: The Legacy of Mirage Plains
  content: 'Long before roads connected the regions, the people of Mirage Plains
    carved homes into the mountains and drew their livelihood from the stone and
    sand beneath their feet. Rich veins of iron, copper, and crystal transformed
    the highlands into the area''s foremost center of craftsmanship.


    Though
    the mountain paths demand caution, visitors are always greeted by the warm glow
    of the forges that have never truly gone cold.'
